This is github.com/tobischo/gokeepasslib v3.6.1 with one change: Argon2id key
derivation. Upstream v3.6.1 only calls argon2.DKey, and every newer release
requires a Go version newer than 1.24.3. The Argon2id UUID is KeePass's.
The rest of the module is unchanged. It is MIT licensed; see the upstream
repository https://github.com/tobischo/gokeepasslib.
